flowchart LR
  Input[Apple Silicon text or microphone] --> ASR[Local ASR adapter]
  ASR --> Adapter[Olympus loopback adapter]
  Input --> Adapter
  Adapter --> Zeus[Zeus / decision lane]
  Adapter --> Odin[Odin / counsel lane]
  Adapter --> Thor[Thor / implementation lane]
  Zeus --> TTS[Local TTS adapter]
  Odin --> TTS
  Thor --> TTS
  TTS --> AIRI[AIRI renderer and avatar state]
  Adapter -. allowlist only .-> Policy[Security and approval policy]
  Policy -. no direct shell/filesystem/browser/hardware .-> Adapter
